### Trading Core API — open in VS Code (REST Client) or PhpStorm and click "Send Request".
@api = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@alice = alice-demo-token-a1b2c3d4e5f6
@bob = bob-demo-token-f6e5d4c3b2a1

### Place a BUY LIMIT order (reserves quantity x limit_price)
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: alice-order-001

{"asset": "BTC-USD", "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "quantity": "0.01", "limit_price": "60000.00"}

### Retry the exact same request: returns the original response, Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: alice-order-001

{"asset": "BTC-USD", "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "quantity": "0.01", "limit_price": "60000.00"}

### Same key, different body: 409 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: alice-order-001

{"asset": "BTC-USD", "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "quantity": "0.02", "limit_price": "60000.00"}

### MARKET SELL (reserves the holding)
POST {{api}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: bob-order-001

{"asset": "AAPL", "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "quantity": "5"}

### List my orders (filters + cursor pagination)
GET {{api}}/orders?status=PENDING&asset=BTC-USD&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json

### Show one order with executions (replace the uuid)
GET {{api}}/orders/REPLACE-WITH-ORDER-UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancel a PENDING order
DELETE {{api}}/orders/REPLACE-WITH-ORDER-UUID
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json

### Wallet and positions
GET {{api}}/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json

### Market summary (last 24h)
GET {{api}}/market/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Accept: application/json
